{"id":194215321578954,"type":"artist","name":"Elliott Smith","artist":null,"year":1969,"weight":41,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1969-08-06","end":"2003-10-21","kind":"Person","similar":["Heatmiser","Nick Drake","Neutral Milk Hotel","Sparklehorse","Jeff Buckley","Bright Eyes","Sun Kil Moon","The Microphones","Alex G","Adrianne Lenker"],"disambiguation":"US singer‐songwriter","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Elliott_Smith.jpg?width=500","bio":"Steven Paul Smith (6 de agosto de 1969 – 21 de octubre de 2003), mejor conocido como Elliott Smith, fue un cantautor estadounidense de folk. Su instrumento primario fue la guitarra acústica, acompañada en otras canciones por bajo, batería y piano entre otros. Su voz era como un susurro, que en muchas canciones tenía un extraño efecto de doble voz. Vivió casi toda su vida en Portland, Oregon (Estados Unidos).\n\nAntes de empezar su carrera en solitario, tocaba en la banda de rock Heatmiser, con la que llegó a sacar varios discos.","tags":["singer-songwriter","folk","indie","acoustic","indie rock"]},"works":[{"id":158799467845461,"type":"album","name":"Roman Candle","artist":"Elliott Smith","year":1994,"weight":23,"yt":"DCZbnvzRUjQ","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":1248498436761,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1994","rank":80,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":118267099057662,"name":"AOTY Must Hear 1990s","rank":281,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":650,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":87310548737747,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Contemporary Folk","rank":56,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":7}},{"id":149443602695309,"type":"album","name":"Elliott Smith","artist":"Elliott Smith","year":1995,"weight":13,"yt":"sNSKJdGCPrM","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":144801247485670,"name":"Pitchfork: The 150 Best Albums of the 1990s","rank":50,"scaruffi":